<title>FINLAND: RAISIO SEES CLEARLY BETTER 1997 THAN 1996.</title>
<headline>RAISIO SEES CLEARLY BETTER 1997 THAN 1996.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish food group Raision Tehtaat Oy faces a clearly better 1997 than last year, its chief exexutive said on Thursday.</p>
<p>&quot;The outlook for 1997 is clearly better than last year,&quot; CEO Matti Salminen told a news conference. </p>
<p>Raisio earlier said its profit before extraordinary items, and tax in 1996 rose to 166 million markka from 141 million in 1995.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 89 6805 0247</p>
